# independent review (semantic_reviewer; agent:vitana-lane-reviewer returned model_unavailable in this Kiro Web session): changes — all fixed:
#   one module-level outbox store per member shared by every hook instance (one reload re-post, one reconnect flush, no overwrites);
#   legacy group items never auto-re-posted; delivery re-reads the current item (a queued retry of a sent item does nothing) and a second enqueue is a no-op;
#   sign-out (user id change) clears the member's outbox and drops late writes; non-composer callers (calendar invite, profile/meetup buttons) await the stored row and throw on failure;
#   20 s send timeout (DM, fallback insert, group); offline items stay "Sending" and flush on reconnect; a stored legacy message is never marked "Not sent";
#   unsent rows can be discarded (DM + group); delivered receipts re-queued on failure; fallback insert carries reply_to; Retry hidden without a handler;
#   GroupChat sends serialized with a double-tap guard (group persistence across reloads deferred — recorded in the PR).
